@zhaozhuang521 @lalaliat Thank you for the earlier approval and conflict reminder. I have rebased the PR onto current `main` (`c20c19ab`) and resolved the conflict; the new head is `b42e4454`.

The resolution is limited to the timestamp overlap with #6855: it keeps the new process-local interpretation for naive AgentScope timestamps and applies the same normalization to `finished_at`. Focused Python tests (40), Console tests (31), changed-file pre-commit, and the refreshed executable CI checks all pass.

The force-push dismissed the previous approval, so could you please re-review the updated head when convenient? Thank you.

